{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22380","headline":"观儿戏 · 白居易","name":"观儿戏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"髫龀七八岁，绮纨三四儿。\n弄尘复鬭草，尽日乐嬉嬉。\n堂上长年客，鬓间新有丝。\n一看竹马戏，每忆童騃时。\n童騃饶戏乐，老大多忧悲。\n静念彼与此，不知谁是痴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}